OL,3,GNEWSAWellbeing support demand for
OL,4,Acancer patients grows
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cancer charity has seen an increase
OL,7,Fin demand for wellbeing support over
OL,8,Fthe past five years, a reports says.
OL,10,FMacmillan Cancer Support Jersey
OL,11,Fpublished its annual report which
OL,12,Flooked back at the charity's work
OL,13,Fduring 2025 and the progress made over
OL,14,Fits five year strategy period from 2021
OL,15,Fto 2025.
OL,17,FThe charity said counselling and
OL,18,Fhigher-level emotional-support sessions
OL,19,Fmore than doubled in Jersey from 407 in
OL,20,F2021 to 835 in 2025 - an increase of
OL,21,F105%.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
